Why this license
----------------

RethLab is built to be free for everyone who wants to learn the Rust Ethereum
stack — and to stay that way. CC BY-NC-SA keeps the door open for translation,
study groups, classroom use, and personal study, while preventing the content
from being silently absorbed into a paid course or commercial product.

If you have a use case that isn't clearly covered (corporate training,
conference workshop, derived non-commercial project that wants a different
license, etc.), open an issue or reach out — the goal is to keep the content
spreading, not to be obstructive.
